440 0 obj
<</ActualText(Senior UX Designer with 9 years of experience working at a global enterprise software company designing enterprise software, mobile applications, and AI-driven conversational experiences. Expertise in user research, interaction design, prototyping, and co\
nversation design, with a strong focus on solving complex product problems through research-led thinking. Currently leading the design of a multi-agent AI onboarding assistant, the first AI UI project at AMCS built using Claude Code with MCP integrations \
to Figma and Storybook. Proven ability to collaborate with cross-functional teams including engineers, product owners, and stakeholders to deliver experiences that meet business objectives and work for real users. Skilled in Figma, Claude Code, HTML and C\
SS, and well-versed in UX principles, usability testing, design systems, and user journey mapping. Passionate about the intersection of AI and user experience, and driven to design systems.)/K 5/P 471 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
