452 0 obj
<</ActualText(AI Portal  Customer Hub)/K 17/P 483 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
453 0 obj
<</ActualText(UX Design lead on a multi-agent AI onboarding assistant replacing a fragmented multi-step form with a conversational experience. Built and iterated directly using Claude Code. Developed UX agents trained on internal guidelines to generate consistent UI. R\
educed target signup time from over 15 minutes to under 5.)/K 18/P 484 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
454 0 obj
<</ActualText(Next Gen Mobile  Route Navigation)/K 19/P 485 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
455 0 obj
<</ActualText(Led UX design for AMCS Mobile field operations app. Spent a week with a material management customer in Amsterdam riding collection routes and interviewing drivers and dispatch teams. Redesigned the core navigation model from individual job completion to \
GPS-driven street completion. Research directly contributed to the customer signing up to the full AMCS platform.)/K 20/P 486 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
456 0 obj
<</ActualText(Design System and Vendor Workcenter)/K 21/P 487 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
457 0 obj
<</ActualText(Contributed to the AMCS platform design system, defining component patterns and UX principles across multiple product teams. Designed the Vendor Workcenter, a net new module covering performance dashboards, compliance tracking, job oversight, and bill mat\
ching. Created AI-consumable design system documentation to support Claude Code workflows.)/K 22/P 488 0 R/Pg 498 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
